	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_sportsm_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まいにち　はしりつづけて
めざすは　イッシュちほうの▽
マラソンチャンピオン！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>毎日　走り続けて
目指すは　イッシュ地方の▽
マラソンチャンピオン！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ変更予定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T10:39:53" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_mountain_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　もりのみち　だけどよ▼
きった　きは　ホドモエシティから
せかいに　とどけられるんだと</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この　森の道　だけどよ▼
切った　木は　ホドモエシティから
世界に　届けられるんだと</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ変更予定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T10:39:55" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MOUNTAIN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_assistantw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フィトンチッドって　しってる？▼
なんだか　よくわからないけど
もりの　なかが　きもちいいのは▽
フィトンチッドの　おかげ　だって！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フィトンチッドって　知ってる？▼
なんだか　よくわからないけど
森林の　中が　心地良いのは▽
フィトンチッドの　おかげ　だって！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
※swanでメッセージ変更予定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T10:40:01" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ASSISTANTW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_stop_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うーむ……　かんじるのお……
てごわい　ポケモンの　そんざいを</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
